moin-markdown (1.11.0+md3-1) unstable; urgency=high

  * New upstream version 1.11.0+md3, security fixes:
    - limits for the form data (memory, number of multipart parts, size):
      denial of service without login (CVE-2023-25577 of the bundled
      Werkzeug); new options max_form_memory_size, max_form_parts,
      max_content_length;
    - Markdown pages and the recognition of the page markup cannot keep
      the server busy any more (quadratic time cases);
    - Markdown pages with U+E000/U+E001 characters can be shown;
    - httponly session cookie by default.
  * README.Debian: security notes.

 -- Gabriele 'asbesto' Zaverio <asbesto@freaknet.org>  Sat, 10 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0200

moin-markdown (1.11.0+md2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New upstream version 1.11.0+md2:
    - the markup of pages without a #format line (Markdown or MoinMoin
      wiki markup) is recognized from their text; new option
      markup_autodetect;
    - "#format moin" is the same as "#format wiki";
    - the help pages of all the language packs mention Markdown and link
      to HelpOnMarkdown / AiutoSuMarkdown.
  * The package is installable on older releases too (Debian 11, Devuan 4,
    Ubuntu 22.04): the dependency on python3-supported-max is replaced
    by python3 (<< 3.13).

 -- Gabriele 'asbesto' Zaverio <asbesto@freaknet.org>  Fri, 09 Oct 2026 20:00:00 +0200

moin-markdown (1.11.0+md1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New project, based on moin 1.10.0-1 (MoinMoin 1.9.11 ported to
    Python 3): pages can be written in Markdown ("#format markdown" or
    default_markup = 'markdown'), next to the pages in MoinMoin wiki syntax.
    - new parser MoinMoin/parser/text_markdown.py (Python-Markdown) with
      wiki links, interwiki links, attachments, MoinMoin macros, syntax
      highlighting, blocks in wiki/creole/rst/csv syntax, headings used by
      TableOfContents, backlinks and page cache; raw HTML is not rendered
      and only safe URL schemes are allowed;
    - Markdown headings at the top of a page are not processing
      instructions;
    - TableOfContents also works in the preview of unsaved pages;
    - new pages HelpOnMarkdown, AiutoSuMarkdown and MarkdownTemplate;
    - new configuration option markdown_extensions.
  * Binary package python3-moinmoin-markdown, it replaces python3-moinmoin.
  * Static files are served under /moin_static1110.
  * Made by Gabriele 'asbesto' Zaverio with the assistance of Claude
    (Anthropic AI); the files written or modified by Claude are marked
    with a comment at their top.

 -- Gabriele 'asbesto' Zaverio <asbesto@freaknet.org>  Fri, 09 Oct 2026 18:00:00 +0200
